      "cooked": "<p>Hi <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/dhruv_patel\">@dhruv_patel</a></p>\n<p>Use <code>app_include_js</code> on hooks.py</p>\n<p>See this:</p>\n<aside class=\"quote quote-modified\" data-post=\"1\" data-topic=\"100711\">\n  <div class=\"title\">\n    <div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n    <img alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/user_avatar/discuss.frappe.io/erpnextnoob1/48/56043_2.png\" class=\"avatar\">\n    <div class=\"quote-title__text-content\">\n      <a href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/t/how-to-create-a-custom-button-on-the-erpnext-home-page/100711\">How to create a custom button on the ERPNext Home Page?</a> <a class=\"badge-category__wrapper \" href=\"/c/erpnext/6\"><span data-category-id=\"6\" style=\"--category-badge-color: #BF1E2E; --category-badge-text-color: #FFFFFF;\" data-drop-close=\"true\" class=\"badge-category --style-square \"><span class=\"badge-category__name\">ERPNext</span></span></a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <blockquote>\n    Hello everyone! \nStarted using ERPNext just yesterday and I want some customisation on my system. \nI want to write a script which would let me create a Custom button on the Homepage, but I am confused about what DocType to use and the ApplyTo. \nPlease help me. \n <a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/6/d/6dbf9092f08069761cb29d0fffa0870ececfb91e.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/6dbf9092f08069761cb29d0fffa0870ececfb91e\" title=\"IMG-20230204-WA0000~2\">[IMG-20230204-WA0000~2]</a> \nWhich DocType to select to make the Button appear on the Home Page?\n  </blockquote>\n</aside>\n\n<p>Hope this helps.</p>",
